# Methods of Building Cost Analysis.

**Authors:** 

## Abstract
Presentation of symposium papers includes--(1) a study describing techniques for economic analysis of building designs, (2) three case studies of analysis techniques, (3) procedures for measuring the area and volume of buildings, and (4) an open forum discussion. Case studies evaluate--(1) the thermal economics of building enclosures, (2) an economic analysis of integrated lighting, and (3) computer optimization of building systems of more than three variables. (MH)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=ED027710

